Package: aipster-worker
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AIPSTER
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: AIPSTER local worker (tray + console launcher)
 Ships the reviewed standalone worker as a per-user desktop program:
 a status window with Start/Stop/Connect/Pair/Settings, a foreground
 server on loopback, and the account-pairing sender. First run creates
 the private data directory ~/.local/share/aipster-worker (config,
 API token, pairing, state, logs); uninstall and upgrade preserve it.
 .
 Simulation only by default: the bundled engine answers locally, nothing
 is shared until you pair this computer with your AIPSTER account.
